# Vorath has fallen (Milestone 28d). In his chamber, the party and Frank -
# whose true name the world has finally heard. Then the ending movie.

spawn {a1} {a1} at ~-1,1 facing up
spawn {a2} {a2} at ~1,1 facing up
spawn {a3} {a3} at ~0,2 facing up
spawn frank frank at ~0,-1 facing down
narrate The last of the void bleeds out of the chamber. Somewhere far above, for the first time in an age, the sky is clear.
emote frank note
say Frank: It's done. The cycle turns again - clean, the way it was meant to.
say Vael: Frank... or should we call you something else now?
say Frank: Frank will do. I've grown fond of it. It's what's left of my name after a few thousand years of people shortening it.
say Ryn: You knew. All this time, from the first cell. You knew what we were walking into.
say Frank: I knew what you could be. That's not the same thing. You did the walking.
say Lyra: Will you stay? Valdris could use someone who remembers the old ages.
say Frank: Valdris has four someones now. I've kept watch long enough. It's time I let the cycle carry me, the way Vorath never would.
emote player !
say Silas: So that's it? You just... go?
say Frank: Everyone goes, friend. The trick is leaving the world better than you found it.
say Frank: And you lot? You've left it in very good shape indeed. That one's on the house.
fade out 2
